WEBVTT

00:04:58.979 --> 00:05:00.359
We create it.

00:05:00.383 --> 00:05:02.673
And whether we realize it or not,

00:05:02.697 --> 00:05:08.160
our day-to-day habits contribute
to the creation of violence

00:05:08.184 --> 00:05:09.738
in our environment.

00:05:09.762 --> 00:05:14.978
So here's a couple of habits
that I've learned contribute to violence.

00:05:16.322 --> 00:05:19.562
One of the first things that attackers did

00:05:19.586 --> 00:05:23.392
when preparing themselves
for a violent event

00:05:23.416 --> 00:05:27.111
was they enclosed themselves
in an information bubble.

00:05:27.135 --> 00:05:29.693
We've heard of fake news, yeah?

00:05:29.717 --> 00:05:32.094
Well, this shocked me: